# The client's own build context.
#
# The image carries the server and nothing it does not need at run time, so the suite, the
# lockfile's install cache and anything a local run leaves behind stay out of the context rather
# than being copied in and deleted again. `Gemfile.lock`, `Gemfile`, `bin/`, `lib/`, `data/`,
# `config.ru` and `README.md` are the whole of what the Dockerfile copies.
.git
.github
test/
.bundle/
vendor/
tmp/
*.gem
*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
.direnv
